module meta/examples/ex00_template

/*
 * PATTERN:  <one line — the modeling pattern this file demonstrates>
 * UML:      <the UML construct it corresponds to, if any>
 * FP:       <the functional-programming analogue, if any>
 * USE WHEN:  <when a designer should reach for this>
 * AVOID:     <the tempting wrong alternative and why>
 * SEE ALSO:  <meta/* module(s); modeling-conventions §N; a real domain module>
 *
 * Copy this file to exNN_pattern_name.als (module meta/examples/exNN_pattern_name).
 * Module path components cannot start with a digit, hence the `ex` prefix.
 * Keep it self-contained: open only the meta/* machinery you demonstrate and define
 * your own toy Hotel sigs (Hotel, Room, RoomType, Reservation, Guest, RatePlan).
